  "index.html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <title>Naman Kedia \u2014 Windows 98 Enterprise Portfolio</title>\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Authentic Windows 98 desktop portfolio and operating system experience for Naman Kedia, Senior Member of Technical Staff (SMTS) \u2014 Frontend Infrastructure.\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Naman Kedia \u2014 Windows 98 Enterprise Portfolio\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Authentic Windows 98 desktop portfolio and operating system experience for Naman Kedia, Senior Member of Technical Staff (SMTS) \u2014 Frontend Infrastructure.\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" />\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin />\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=VT323&family=Courier+Prime:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&family=Pixelify+Sans:wght@500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div id=\"root\"></div>\n    <script type=\"module\" src=\"/src/main.tsx\"></script>\n  </body>\n</html>\n\n",
  "README.md": "# Naman Kedia \u2014 Windows 98 Enterprise Portfolio\n\nAn authentic retro Windows 98 desktop operating system and portfolio for **Naman Kedia**, Senior Member of Technical Staff (SMTS) \u2014 Frontend Infrastructure at ThoughtSpot (Ex-Dell Technologies).\n\n![Windows 98 Desktop Portfolio](https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDI7LOwbWJ3yiOsgCuLfeizH6CwYCQvpNYlb_RYYUmlgOba88uWkcJqkIjDdltNLKpcSW8huTa5yl66awUu6_j6_x8bDR1qPmCt_V6RlCNTFMqgj_sI1Oc4PxbvwLGeemWUH8kW4rOiKJDggCwNKRJ2QBi65S7oYskKox03KvAYtxQcqOELNHEv3Sd3MAKjLvgyIvZdL1p_DQPOUli9VIUTGbpYp310Li_sjj2cqyjwGRqYHqWOqsUhRIgF_Iz4H_LYBw)\n\n---\n\n## \ud83c\udf1f Key Features\n\n- **Classic Windows 98 OS Aesthetic**:\n  - Authentic 3D beveled inset and outset borders, system gray palettes, and navy titlebars.\n  - Interactive Desktop Icons (*My Computer*, *Experience.log*, *Projects.dir*, *Honors.doc*, *Connect.msg*, *Internet Explorer*, *Recycle Bin*, *MS-DOS Prompt*).\n  - Vintage CRT scanline filter overlay with toggle switch.\n  - Web Audio API retro sound synthesis (clicks, startup chords, minimize tones, error alerts).\n\n- **Windows & Applications**:\n  1. **BIO_V98.EXE**: System status telemetry HUD, Georgia Tech & Dell pedigree, profile photo viewer, and 4-metric benchmark tiles.\n  2. **Properties: C:\\Career\\Experience.log**: 4 interactive tabs detailing ThoughtSpot, Dell Full-Time, Dell Internship & PPO, and Freelance engineering impact.\n  3. **Exploring - Projects**: File explorer directory featuring `PORTAL.EXE`, `AR_VIEW.EXE`, `TEMPLATES.DLL`, and `SPINWHEEL.JS`.\n  4. **Academic Pedigree & Honors**: Dual-window view highlighting Georgia Tech MS CS (HCI, 3.60 GPA), IIIT Bhubaneswar, GeeksforGeeks author achievements (200+ articles), Dell Hackathons, CTF championships, and seed funding.\n  5. **Connect Dialog**: Direct channel card with clipboard email copy and Outlook Express-styled direct dispatch form.\n\n- **Interactive Mini-Apps & Easter Eggs**:\n  - \ud83c\udfa1 **SpinWheel.js**: HTML5 Canvas 2D physics wheel with angular deceleration equations.\n  - \ud83d\ude80 **PORTAL.EXE**: Interactive developer portal simulation for 30s enterprise repository scaffolding.\n  - \ud83d\udc53 **AR_VIEW.EXE**: Spatial 3D hardware configurator with exploded component view.\n  - \ud83d\udca3 **Minesweeper**: Fully playable 9x9 retro game with timers, mine counters, and smiley resets.\n  - \ud83d\udcbb **MS-DOS Prompt**: Working command shell (`C:\\NAMAN>`) supporting `HELP`, `BIO`, `EXP`, `SKILLS`, `PROJECTS`, `DIR`, and `CLS`.\n  - \ud83e\ude9f **Start Menu**: Cascading Windows 98 menu with theme color switchers (Classic Teal, Windows 95 Navy, CRT Matrix Green, Slate).\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Tech Stack\n\n- **Framework**: React 19 + TypeScript\n- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS\n- **Build Tool**: Vite\n- **Audio Engine**: Web Audio API Synthesizer\n- **Icons & Fonts**: Pixelify Sans, VT323, Courier Prime, Material Symbols\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\ude80 Getting Started\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- Node.js (v18+)\n- npm or bun\n\n### Installation\n\n```bash\n# Clone the repository\ngit clone https://github.com/naman-ked/webd.git\n\n# Navigate to project directory\ncd webd\n\n# Install dependencies\nnpm install\n\n# Start development server\nnpm run dev\n```\n\nThe app will be accessible at `http://localhost:3000`.\n\n### Production Build\n\n```bash\nnpm run build\nnpm run preview\n```\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udcec Contact & Links\n\n- **Engineer**: Naman Kedia (SMTS \u2014 Frontend Infrastructure)\n- **Email**: nkedia1234@gmail.com\n- **Phone / WhatsApp**: +91 6204725960\n- **GitHub**: [@ked27](https://github.com/ked27)\n- **Location**: Hyderabad, Telangana, India\n",
